{"step_index":11356,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-26T15:21:13Z","content":"# Resuming from a compaction\n\nYou are continuing work on the task described above, but you have lost access to the full conversation history, and need to resume work efficiently using the progress summary below:\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. Eo dutoi irak iroan folder er oi sub folder e rakho,....and cpu er live monitoring er graph kaaj korse naa.....aar windows explorer er site ta slow\n2. Windows home e cpu buttton e click korle kisu dekhay naa\n3. [ছবি ইনপুট: /home/azureuser/.webterminal/media/media_1790432959099_A59D1C82.jpeg]. ইউজারের ক্যাপশন/প্রশ্ন: \"Marking kora jaygay back button, ekta home button, and cpu button dao......aar eikhane storage er hisab thik ase? May be not.....Windows 11 home button is unnecessary,.................And Cpu monitoring grapgh you actuaaly misunderstood......Dekho....grapgh e 1 hour er niche jemon 1 minute select korle,,,,you have to understand that,,,,,,,,,,1 minute is not 1 second,,,,,,Ei somoy whole grapgh lafanor kisu nai.......dhoro last second jemon 58 to  59 second er ghrapgh tai lafabe......aaar bakigulo already static,,,, karon oi somoy par hoye gese aar fire asbe naa\". অনুগ্রহ করে view_file(\"/home/azureuser/.webterminal/media/media_1790432959099_A59D1C82.jpeg\") ব্যবহার করে ছবিটি দেখুন এবং বিস্তারিত সঠিক উত্তর দিন।\n4. https://constraint-marion-casio-aircraft.trycloudflare.com\n\n\nEta pin kore rakho\n5. Again pin\n6. Back button ta most right side e dao.....right hand side\n7. Ekhon base folder ki azureuse naki onno kisu? Seta ekhankar folder. Structure noy,,,,azure er official data onujayi konta......search. 3 alternative verify data\n8. Eikhane 3 ta test kore janao which one is base folder.....seta guidelines follow korei...not from your mind\n9. Now make a copy of whole. Gemini folder inside IrakIroan folder, and tell me after completion\n10. https://constraint-marion-casio-aircraft.trycloudflare.com\n\n\nEi linktaate property dekhar bebostha kore dao, w11 er moto...eto option lagbe naa,,,,only folder size and file count\n\n<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **User Request:**\n  \"https://constraint-marion-casio-aircraft.trycloudflare.com\n  Ei linktaate property dekhar bebostha kore dao, w11 er moto...eto option lagbe naa,,,,only folder size and file count\"\n- **Objective:**\n  Implement a Windows 11 style **Properties dialog / modal** in the Azure File Explorer web application hosted at `/home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer/`.\n- **Scope & Constraints:**\n  - \"eto option lagbe naa\" — keep it clean and minimal, without unnecessary complex tabs.\n  - MUST show:\n    1. **Folder Size** (human-readable string e.g. `72.70 MB` AND exact bytes e.g. `76,226,563 bytes`).\n    2. **File & Folder Count** (e.g., `Contains: 4,551 Files, 3,544 Folders`).\n    3. Essential details: Name, Location/Path, Type (`File folder` or specific file type), and Last Modified date.\n  - Accessible on desktop and mobile:\n    - Dedicated info button `( ℹ️ )` on each row/card.\n    - Right-click / touch long-press context menu (`Properties`).\n    - Toolbar \"Properties\" button for selected item or current folder.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Backend Benchmarking Completed:**\n  - Tested Linux commands: `du -sb <path>` took ~0.15s for 8,000 files in `.gemini`.\n  - Tested fast file counting: `find <path> -type f -printf . | wc -c` took ~0.09s for 4,551 files.\n  - Verified huge directory protection: for directories with 500k+ files (e.g. `Google_Drive_Backup`), use timeouts (3.5–4.0s) and in-memory caching (`_properties_cache` with 60s TTL) so requests never hang.\n- **Service & Infrastructure State:**\n  - Systemd service: `azure-file-explorer.service` (Port 8088) is active.\n  - Tunnel service: `azure-file-explorer-tunnel.service` maintaining `https://constraint-marion-casio-aircraft.trycloudflare.com`.\n  - Pinned links persisted in `/home/azureuser/PINNED_LINKS.md`, `/home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer/README.md`, and conversation artifact `pinned_live_links.md`.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings & Design Decisions\n1. **Properties Backend (`server.py`):**\n   - Route `/api/properties?path=<path>`:\n     - For files: uses `os.stat` (instant <1ms), returns `size`, `size_str`, `size_bytes_str`, `files_count: 1`, `folders_count: 0`.\n     - For folders: uses `du -sb` (with fallback to `du -sk` or shallow scandir) and `find ... -printf .` with a 3.5s timeout.\n     - Caching: stores result in `_properties_cache[target_path]` so repeated clicks are instantaneous (<2ms).\n2. **Properties Frontend (`static/index.html`):**\n   - Modal overlay: `#propertiesModal` styled as a Windows 11 Fluent dark window (acrylic border, hero icon + name, divider, type, location, size with bytes, file & folder count, modified date, and \"OK\" button).\n   - In table view: add a small `ℹ️` icon on the right of each row (`onclick=\"event.stopPropagation(); showProperties('...')\"`).\n   - In grid view: add `ℹ️` icon or long-press.\n   - Toolbar button: `[ ℹ️ Properties ]` next to the search box that inspects the current directory if nothing is selected.\n   - Context Menu: Custom right-click / long-press menu showing `Open`, `Properties`, and `Download`.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Active Context\n- **Files to Modify:**\n  1. [`/home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer/server.py`](file:///home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer/server.py)\n     - Add route `elif path == \"/api/properties\":`\n     - Add `_properties_cache = {}` and `handle_properties(self, target_path)`.\n  2. [`/home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer/static/index.html`](file:///home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer/static/index.html)\n     - Add CSS for `.win11-properties-window`, `.prop-table`, `.custom-context-menu`.\n     - Add HTML for `#propertiesModal` and `#customContextMenu`.\n     - Add JS functions: `showProperties(path)`, `closeProperties()`, `openCurrentFolderProperties()`.\n     - Add `ℹ️` button to table rows in `renderFiles()`.\n- **Public URL:**\n  `https://constraint-marion-casio-aircraft.trycloudflare.com`\n\n---\n\n### 5. Next Steps (In Exact Priority Order)\n1. **Add `/api/properties` to `server.py`:**\n   - In `do_GET()` around line 221:\n     ```python\n     elif path == \"/api/properties\":\n         target_path = params.get(\"path\", [\"/home/azureuser\"])[0]\n         self.handle_properties(target_path)\n     ```\n   - Implement `_properties_cache = {}` and `handle_properties(self, target_path)`.\n2. **Add Properties Modal, Styles & JS to `static/index.html`:**\n   - Add `.win11-properties-window` styles.\n   - Add `#propertiesModal` HTML markup.\n   - In `renderFiles(items)`: add `ℹ️` button to table rows.\n   - Add `async function showProperties(path)`: fetches `/api/properties?path=...`, displays loader then renders size and file/folder counts.\n   - Add `closeProperties()`.\n3. **Restart Service & Verify:**\n   - Run `systemctl --user restart azure-file-explorer.service`.\n   - Test with `curl -s \"http://127.0.0.1:8088/api/properties?path=/home/azureuser/IrakIroan/.gemini\"`.\n   - Test via tunnel URL: `curl -s \"https://constraint-marion-casio-aircraft.trycloudflare.com/api/properties?path=/home/azureuser/IrakIroan/.gemini\"`.\n4. **Respond to Iraq Bhai:**\n   - Address as \"ইরাক ভাইয়া\".\n   - Language: Pure Bengali script.\n   - Formatting: Single asterisks `*` only (NO `**`), clamped dividers `«──────────────────────────────»` (30-32 chars), max line length ~48-50 chars.\n   - Explain how to view properties (click `ℹ` button on any row or use context menu), showing folder size and file/folder counts exactly like Windows 11.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Address user as: \"ইরাক ভাইয়া\".\n- Response language: Pure Bengali script (বাংলা লিপি).\n- Formatting: Single asterisks `*` only (NO `**`), clamped dividers `«──────────────────────────────»`.\n- Keep properties simple: ONLY folder size, byte count, file/folder count, type, location, and date (no unnecessary complex options).\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 3 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: delete_proof_40_points_test_report]\nPath: file:///home/azureuser/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/47f3f05e-b686-4d3d-9ae2-f215c03ab86b/delete_proof_40_points_test_report.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-26T02:48:38Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: delete_proof_architecture_implementation]\nPath: file:///home/azureuser/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/47f3f05e-b686-4d3d-9ae2-f215c03ab86b/delete_proof_architecture_implementation.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-26T02:26:43Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: pinned_live_links]\nPath: file:///home/azureuser/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/47f3f05e-b686-4d3d-9ae2-f215c03ab86b/pinned_live_links.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-26T15:04:55Z\n\n# Subagents\nThe following subagents were spawned during this conversation (up to 20).\nView the conversation log to see the full conversation with the subagent and use send_message with the conversation_id to communicate with them.\n\n{\n  \"spec\":  {\n    \"typeName\":  \"ask_and_research\",\n    \"role\":  \"Ask & Research Specialist\",\n    \"initialPrompt\":  \"অনুগ্রহ করে আপনার অ্যাক্টিভেশন যাচাই করুন, বর্তমান ওয়ার্কস্পেস পাথ চেক করুন এবং 'Ask & Research' সাব-এজেন্ট হিসেবে আপনার মূল দায়িত্ব ও ক্ষমতা বাংলা লিপিতে সংক্ষিপ্তভাবে রিপোর্ট করুন।\",\n    \"inherit\":  true,\n    \"model\":  \"MODEL_PLACEHOLDER_M322\",\n    \"modelTier\":  \"MODEL_TIER_FLASH\"\n  },\n  \"result\":  {\n    \"conversationId\":  \"97a12c58-ac5f-42a8-a933-07336c81795c\",\n    \"logAbsoluteUri\":  \"file:///home/azureuser/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/97a12c58-ac5f-42a8-a933-07336c81795c/.system_generated/logs/transcript.jsonl\",\n    \"workspaceUris\":  [\n      \"file:///home/azureuser\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"spawnStepIndex\":  2747\n}"}
